WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.463
Welcome to The Motoring Central. Everything your car needs, in one place. Here's how it works.

00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:12.634
Start by typing what you need, in your own words. Or tap one of the quick buttons, like Car service, or MOT.

00:00:13.384 --> 00:00:18.141
As you type, matching problems and services appear. Just tap the one that sounds right.

00:00:18.891 --> 00:00:23.008
Not sure what's wrong? That's fine. Tap “Let a garage or mechanic decide”.

00:00:23.758 --> 00:00:31.395
Tell us what's happening, and local garages and mechanics will check your car, then tell you what it needs, and the price, before any work starts.

00:00:32.145 --> 00:00:36.412
To see exact prices, register for free, then enter your registration.

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:40.469
We find your exact car, so the parts and the prices are right.

00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:46.083
Compare checked local partners by price, rating and reviews, and choose the one you want.

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:50.865
You see the full, fixed price before you book, and you pay securely online.

00:00:51.615 --> 00:00:55.690
Your bookings, reminders and messages are all in one place, in My account.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:00.280
The Motoring Central. Buy, fix, clean, rescue. Let's get started.
